    /Section 4. Annual Meeting./ The annual meeting of the members shall
    nominally be held at such place and time as the Directors shall
    designate. The Secretary/Treasurer shall serve personally, or by
    personal telephone conversation
    <http://www.lojban.org/llg/#1992_Art3_Sec4_r3>,[3] or send through
    the post office or by electronic mail
    <http://www.lojban.org/llg/#1992_Art3_Sec4_r3>[3] addressed to each
    member at his last known address, at least fifteen (15)
    <http://www.lojban.org/llg/#1992_Art3_Sec4_r1>[1] days before such
    meeting a notice thereof.


